# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Two kinds of file must never be committed.
#
# 1. REAL SCHOOL DATA. Anything exported from Oracle holds students' names,
#    their parents' names, mobile numbers and dates of birth. A public repo is
#    forever -- a later `git rm` does not remove it from history.
# 2. CREDENTIALS THAT ARE ACTUALLY SECRET. The Firebase *web* config (apiKey
#    and friends) is public by design and is fine in the source; a Firebase
#    ADMIN service-account key is not, and neither is a keystore.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. data exported from Oracle, and anything derived from it
#    NOTE: scoped to tools/data, NOT a bare `data/`. A bare rule also matched
#    web/src/data/ and silently kept the attendance data layer out of the
#    repo -- caught on 2026-11-15 only by reading the staged file list.
export/
exports/
tools/data/
*.csv
*.ndjson
tools/*.json
!tools/package.json
!tools/mapping.sample.json

# 2. real secrets
serviceAccount*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
google-services.json

# node / web
node_modules/
web/dist/
.firebase/
*.log

# android
*.apk
*.aab
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
.idea/
*.iml

# os
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
